WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:02.640
If you haven’t heard of a District Plan
before,

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:05.020
it’s essentially the planning rule book for our District.

00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:08.560
From how and where you can sub-divide,

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:11.260
to ways we can protect our bio-diversity,

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:14.180
to how we can make space for new retail activities.

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:16.680
All covered by the District Plan.

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:19.380
Now it’s time for it to be reviewed

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:22.820
and we want to make sure it meets our District’s future needs.

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:26.820
We have some proposed changes and we'd like your feedback.

00:00:26.820 --> 00:00:32.540
Take a look at and have your say at waimakariri.govt.nz/letstalk

